    old "Honestly… I'd do it without being asked! Everyone, let's go!{#ch14_l_013}"
    new "Ну же… Я и так бы сделала! Всем идём!"

    old "Mm.{#ch14_t_001}"
    new "Мм."

    old "Really, Kirche, what were you thinking…!{#ch14_l_014}"
